CHAPTER.VERS:
And there fell ten portions to 

          In the land of canaan: five to the males: and other five to the daughters of Zelophehad.
         Manasseh, beside the land of Gilead and Bashan, which [were] on the other side Jordan;

[Now] Manasseh had the land of Tappuah: but 

          Meaning, the city itself.
         Tappuah on the border of Manasseh [belonged] to the children of Ephraim;
